The writ petitioner has challenged the aforesaid judgment and decree on the following two main grounds ;

(i') That respondent No. 1 .did not tender or return the ornaments as directed by the Judge Family Court to the petitioner by 28-2-1982 and since the condition had not been fulfilled by that date, her suit stood dismissed and she continued to remain in the Nikah of the petitioner as his wife, and

(ii) that the petitioner was not given opportunity by the Court to produce his witnesses.
